ext\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f17fe657-81a2-4a85-9927-6b9f203c0947\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-af997f42-d947-4874-bca5-69a415cfe6af\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6437bca8-570d-4d5c-a7cf-f3e10045fcfb\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7b0cd7cd-2bdb-4eaf-8f1f-d555fbe79df6\">입니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2f0aa2cc-8aa4-42ff-a43f-8a66ccd26c22\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-923532d6-221f-47ee-aedb-607821efa287\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6421477a-ed61-4c0a-bdfd-2c01ba07377e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-04eb6038-abd7-4ff5-a5b8-fd636acc0421\">11/12(화) 18:30 ~ 20:30 경에 무점검 업데이트 및</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f5d925ec-a01d-4c49-9848-b80fc81f8301\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7939f20d-c8a7-4554-a741-a8652b08f182\">업데이트 리소스 다운로드가 진행되었습니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-21d328ea-62ad-4fcf-abc3-1d68b2e0bda2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ab1706ec-98ca-4e2b-a0d9-f0c1f8c8beb9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-60454c51-d405-4f42-a1dd-bd457454a740\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-612b132e-f52e-4064-8e19-0fd3f9bf1c25\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-754a88c3-33fe-4185-92b9-329022ce7dca\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d56a139c-568b-4113-95bf-30f1f656b2dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-de898960-5549-4743-a72e-10d44424126e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-20389ede-ca78-4942-a035-2eff2ca7c6e2\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ac6a5660-5d82-4faa-a888-07393564bd7f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6567a3ea-0b80-4adc-8de6-0faad29e8d98\"><b>📢 11월 12일(화) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-28983dbb-aca5-40cf-a16d-3af71763bd65\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c8b9a84a-eacd-468a-a405-4e0bc4826740\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a5fdb4cf-0350-4f10-bec3-c35895b50b45\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a9f6df40-1a52-4900-98f1-86a018951813\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1bf31671-613e-480c-aba8-d731362e0353\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9d180973-afa8-44cb-9843-aa261e6ef4ce\">- 11/12(화) 19:00 ~ 20:00 경​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-13da92f3-a7dc-47f1-b4a1-a5cd5ffe67b7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-26549674-0000-4249-921e-044f757fa7a2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-44dc34e6-8493-4245-969d-86d87e4ad76a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cdcf4cff-024a-4c2b-abaf-ebc2742dcfc9\">​</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f852d66c-022d-41ff-b9b2-9b1b99b2ee51\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0c141667-4af7-444b-ae89-c7ed72f178d9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-38461633-93c3-4358-80d2-45e1f9b02411\">- 베히모스의 특정 스킬 공격 중 신데렐라의 버스트 스킬 「유리 구두 풀 컨텍트」 사용 시 게임이 강제 종료되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d3c31b74-0ae9-47d9-acc6-900831d60e1e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-652479a3-b956-4395-a378-6de5da97161e\">- 베히모스와 전투 중 특정 상황에서 베히모스의 페이즈가 전환되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4b237600-5ac4-43e2-92e6-b7a3f95babdf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6d78bfbb-eb3a-4797-94a0-47917aa928ed\">- 베히모스의 특정 스킬이 엄폐 중인 니케에게 간헐적으로 대미지를 입히는 현상을 추가 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9cb93e75-7c3e-4fe1-801d-fd0b2d8024dd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d535f865-6940-4071-9a09-e026c60b0ec2\">- 특정 니케를 스쿼드에 편성할 경우 전투 중 아군의 재장전 모션이 1회 반복되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4f893e82-370a-4ced-811f-9e569412e79c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0d8006ec-bcfb-429a-ae01-b9d79e50aebb\">- 현재 진행 중인 솔로 레이드가 2024년 11월 12일(화) 18:00 ~ 11월 13일(수) 12:00동안 일시 중단됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f93c783a-8434-4f65-bd4b-914cea5332e6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-71306811-3cae-4b2e-a630-dda1bd0b4988\">└ 챌린지 모드의 기록이 초기화되며, 솔로 레이드 시즌 19의 진행 기간이 2일 연장되어 2024년 11월 17일(일) 5:00:00에 종료됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-794945f8-f9b5-4a07-b1f1-62cdd414571b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2948785f-2b47-4caa-9fb2-fd1e0a0185fe\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c453e837-495c-407c-a23d-8baf4f89c0c1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-711c25da-3719-489b-855b-568fe70e7f59\"><b>✔️ 솔로 레이드 일시 중단 보상 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-285209b2-18de-4b1e-8bb8-e66bbc1454e8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5b73c235-00c4-431a-bf4c-4f8f65507b39\">- 소장품 선택 박스 * 1</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-443e051d-7240-4929-b2ce-bc086add7712\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b6d712c8-3717-4b6c-a315-83f783f9abf5\">- 잡동사니 박스 시즌1&amp;2 * 30</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-48f225b9-4765-47dd-8ee1-f3b03bd04281\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c0ef87ac-05d0-46cc-97f8-338237cc15d0\">- 큐브 배터리 무작위 보상 * 28</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d7562ea0-496f-4909-9b7a-01e923acdb20\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d0a9507f-77a5-43e6-96b2-5c6677f0bd4f\">- 관리 키트 상자 II * 27</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3196f0b5-e8f7-4727-9193-636603a64a39\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0705efa6-aea1-44cd-952a-e7237bffd229\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-23a51267-7437-42f1-845e-16b005fe809d\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c04908cd-12a0-473f-aaad-1d961d5bb2aa\">​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-048b7687-f8f9-4a5d-ab3b-38363281cd98\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0514bfbb-43dc-4064-ac29-9c55e98d2077\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6f1ed8dc-d481-4651-af4f-64307344655c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8e24bac9-303d-4f0e-a91d-5ea95e1373ba\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-130af782-ee9e-4495-ad3b-5522b0707ba0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c5a598e3-1f62-4b37-aea7-1fd6f1a55bb2\">·····················································································​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4afea0e2-2e23-4d85-9d44-aebe42238c1e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7dd6911e-d51f-40a6-bafc-046cff6fd151\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-adc03691-d6e4-4df0-ac0c-59aea2bf5db1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-601ad572-9e10-4e8c-a091-d76cf0257ddb\">​게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-74478198-a5d6-4df5-bb47-673fb6da31fb\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-74478198-a5d6-4df5-bb47-673fb6da31fb\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMTJfMjUw/MDAxNzMxNDA5NDY1MjYw.VhyOgrVYVjqwtHcaC8mvhGVsivxj-lE_OE_F8DnLtFwg.VeRbhAgt-W2qd7l3pzGgYIh2_61IyhfEUzQLnVKeCX8g.PNG/%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMTJfMjUw/MDAxNzMxNDA5NDY1MjYw.VhyOgrVYVjqwtHcaC8mvhGVsivxj-lE_OE_F8DnLtFwg.VeRbhAgt-W2qd7l3pzGgYIh2_61IyhfEU